  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've noticed something weird with walking/running animations after the recent update, they seem off and frequently it will make me do a sideways walk. Avatars and their legs are also kind of weird when someone looks around or spins. It isn't just my avatar, I've tried avatars without a custom override and default ones, and I've also noticed it on other Desktop users too. The issue with the legs while standing gets fixed by doing an emote, but then is broken again if you walk in any direction.\nI recorded a demonstration of it: https://youtu.be/uwtTMzp-6_Q",
